  * func_800E6680 -> AudioThread_GetActiveNoteCount
    deduced, confidence HIGH

  * func_800E66A0 -> AudioThread_ReleaseNonRamNotes
    deduced, confidence HIGH

  * func_800E66C0 -> AudioThread_CountAndReleaseNotes
    deduced, confidence HIGH

